    <node id="GPT-4">
      <data key="d2">GPT-4</data>
      <data key="d3">Model</data>
      <data key="d4">An LLM used in the evaluation where GraphRAG strongly outperformed vector RAG.</data>
      <data key="d5">Results show GraphRAG strongly outperforms vector RAG when using GPT-4 as the LLM. | "Achiam, J., Adler, S., Agarwal, S., Ahmad, L., Akkaya, I., Aleman, F. L., Almeida, D., Altenschmidt, J., Altman, S., Anadkat, S., et al. (2023). Gpt-4 technical report. arXiv preprint arXiv:2303.08774."</data>
      <data key="d6">[2, 12]</data>
      <data key="d7">["Results show GraphRAG strongly outperforms vector RAG when using GPT-4 as the LLM.", "\"Achiam, J., Adler, S., Agarwal, S., Ahmad, L., Akkaya, I., Aleman, F. L., Almeida, D., Altenschmidt, J., Altman, S., Anadkat, S., et al. (2023). Gpt-4 technical report. arXiv preprint arXiv:2303.08774.\""]</data>
