    </node>
    <node id="Global Answer">
      <data key="d2">Global Answer</data>
      <data key="d3">Concept</data>
      <data key="d4">The final output produced using query-focused summarization over community summaries.</data>
      <data key="d5">The "global answer" to a given query is produced using a final round of query-focused summarization | This final context is used to generate the global answer returned to the user</data>
      <data key="d6">[4, 6]</data>
      <data key="d7">["The \"global answer\" to a given query is produced using a final round of query-focused summarization", "This final context is used to generate the global answer returned to the user"]</data>
