      <data key="d4">Approaches that significantly outperformed conventional vector RAG in comprehensiveness and diversity criteria.</data>
      <data key="d5">Specifically, global approaches achieved comprehensiveness win rates between 72-83% (p&lt;.001) for Podcast transcripts and 72-80% (p&lt;.001) for News articles, while diversity win rates ranged from 75-82% (p&lt;.001) and 62-71% (p&lt;.01) respectively.</data>
